---
// BeP09 figure: BeP09BurstFlow
---
<figure class="bep9n6">
  <div class="bep9n6-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 310" role="img" aria-label="The load check as a flow. One warm-up request, then 200 requests with 5 in flight at once, then p95 compared with a bound of 70 ms. The eager endpoint at 32 to 38 ms passes. The lazy endpoint at 85 to 88 ms is over the bound, exits with code 1 and fails the build.">
    <rect x="20" y="120" width="150" height="76" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="95" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>1 warm-up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 request</tspan></text>
    <text x="95" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>connection setup</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>khởi tạo kết nối</tspan></text>
    <line x1="170" y1="158" x2="200" y2="158" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="210,158 200,153 200,163" class="hd" />
    <rect x="210" y="120" width="200" height="76" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="310" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>200 requests</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>200 request</tspan></text>
    <text x="310" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>5 in flight at once</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>5 request cùng lúc</tspan></text>
    <line x1="410" y1="158" x2="440" y2="158" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="450,158 440,153 440,163" class="hd" />
    <rect x="450" y="120" width="190" height="76" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="545" y="150" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>p95 vs 70 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>p95 so với 70 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="545" y="172" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>95% of requests beat p95</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>95% request nhanh hơn p95</tspan></text>
    <line x1="640" y1="158" x2="665" y2="158" class="ln" />
    <line x1="665" y1="62" x2="665" y2="254" class="ln" />
    <line x1="665" y1="62" x2="690" y2="62" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="700,62 690,57 690,67" class="hd" />
    <line x1="665" y1="254" x2="690" y2="254" class="redln" />
    <polygon points="700,254 690,249 690,259" class="redhd" />
    <rect x="700" y="28" width="180" height="68" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="790" y="56" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>/eager: 32 to 38 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>/eager: 32 đến 38 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="790" y="78" text-anchor="middle" class="bs"><tspan data-lang-en>under 70 ms: pass</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dưới 70 ms: pass</tspan></text>
    <rect x="700" y="220" width="180" height="68" rx="10" class="redbox" />
    <text x="790" y="248" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>/lazy: 85 to 88 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>/lazy: 85 đến 88 ms</tspan></text>
    <text x="790" y="270" text-anchor="middle" class="redt"><tspan data-lang-en>over 70 ms: exit 1, fail</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trên 70 ms: exit 1, fail</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The whole check is a few steps and a number to compare. The exit code is what lets CI treat it like any other failing test.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cả check chỉ là vài bước và một con số để so sánh. Exit code là thứ cho phép CI coi nó như mọi test fail khác.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep9n6 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep9n6-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep9n6 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; }
  .bep9n6 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep9n6 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n6 .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep9n6 .bs { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .bep9n6 .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep9n6 .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep9n6 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep9n6 .redbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n6 .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep9n6 .redln { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.2; }
  .bep9n6 .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep9n6 .redhd { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n6 .bar { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .bep9n6 .redbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep9n6 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
